Description: Interactive exploration of a Summarized experiment and associated DE analyses. A shiny
 app to inspect and interact with pre-calculated differential expression and functional 
 enrichment results, to facilitate comparisons between multiple models, and to include known associations,
 such as genetic risk factors. This is meant to be a tool for exploration and discussion, rather than analysis.
